    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Telling the time",
     "texto": [
      "The time is said with the number + **じ**: **3 じ** (three o'clock). «Half past» is **はん**: **3 じ はん** (half past three). The most common special readings are **4 じ → よじ**, **7 じ → しちじ** and **9 じ → くじ**.",
      "Minutes use **ふん** or **ぷん**; some change their sound. **5 ふん**, **10 ぷん**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
