    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What time, from and until",
     "texto": [
      "The time at which you do something takes **に**: **7 じ に おきます** (I get up at seven).",
      "**から** = from. **まで** = until. **9 じ から 5 じ まで** = from nine to five.",
      "To ask: **いま なんじ です か** (what time is it now?) and **なんじ に** (at what time?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
